	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Salutem et in Christo, servatore nostro, pacem etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Dedi ad te mense iunio literas<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Oben <ref target="file11799">Nr. 1753</ref>.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quae utrum redditę sint, me latet, nam erat tabellarius<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Unbekannt.</note> michi valde<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>Vor</hi> valde <hi>gestrichenes</hi> satis.</note> ignotus neque <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>michi certo promittere audebat, an hę ad te dari per eundem possint nec ne.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Argumentum vero illarum et summa erat gratiarumactio, eo quod in unive<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>rsum<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> univerversum.</note> omnes pariter, quibus commendatus eram et quibus non eram, me hominem ignotum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ac indoctum omni humanitate exceperitis, tum denique, quod in his, quae michi<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">michi <hi>über gestrichenem, unlesbarem Wort.</hi></note> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>erant scitu necessaria ac cognitu<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">cognitu <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> digna, vestra omnium opera valde sim adiutus, neque <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>dubito, quin et eadem deinceps, ubi saltem literis significavero, semper me sitis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>adiuturi, pręsertim in rebus theologicis, quarum mehercle vos<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e"><hi>Vor</hi> vos <hi>gestrichenes</hi> vos verum.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/><placeName ref="l587">Tygurinos</placeName> ecclesiastes <foreign xml:lang="el">ἀρχιερεῖς</foreign> cognovi.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Igitur eadem nunc scribens idem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>volo, quod superioribus ostendi literis.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Fuisset quidem decum[!], ut non solum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>pro tantis erga me beneficiis haberem, sed et manu (ut aiunt)<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Vgl. <persName ref="p19911">Ovid</persName>, Fasti, 2, 636; <persName ref="p5396">Juvenal</persName>, Saturae, 10, 302; <persName ref="p18867">Vergil</persName>, Aeneis, 10, 619f.</note> larga referrem <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>gratiam; verumenimvero dubium non est<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f">dubium non est <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note>, ex quo res non secus fert vel<note xml:id="fng" type="footnote" n="g"><hi>Vor</hi> vel <hi>gestrichenes</hi> scio vos et[?] voluntatem.</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ut poeta ait,<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p19911">Ovid</persName>, Epistulae ex Ponto, 3, 4, 79.</note> voluntatem meam, cum vires michi desint, quin sitis laudaturi <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>eamque boni consulturi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Pręterea egi tecum, vir observande, his literis superioribus, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quo me tuis ac aliorum doctissimorum virorum lucubrationibus iuvares eo quidem <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>pacto, ut apud compatrem tuum d. <persName ref="p4851">Christophorum Frosch[ouerum]</persName> pro me <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ad dimidii saltem anni tempus spondeas atque is ipse secum ad proximas <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nundinas <placeName ref="l157">Francofordienses</placeName>, quae quidem in festo Bartholomei<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Am 24. August. Zum Termin der <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurter</placeName> Herbstmesse s. <bibl source="b8">HBBW VI</bibl> <ref target="file10925">[Nr. 884]</ref>, S. 406, Anm.5.</note> celebrantur, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>adferret ibique Ioanni cuidam, bibliopolę <placeName ref="l558">Witembergensi</placeName>,<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Als <placeName ref="l558">Wittenberger</placeName> Buchhändler mit Vornamen Hans/Johannes sind für die in Frage kommende Zeit <persName ref="p5703">Hans Lufft</persName> und <persName ref="p5638">Hans Leffler (Löffler)</persName> nachweisbar, vgl. <bibl source="b260">Grimm</bibl>, Buchführer 1618f. Letzterer arbeitete bis zu seiner Verselbständigung 1544 für <persName ref="p6488">Christoff Schramm</persName> (<bibl source="b261">Grimm, Buchführer</bibl> 1613f).</note> michi allatum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>traderet.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quicquid autem pro his, omnibus inquam tuis scriptis<note xml:id="fnh" type="footnote" n="h"><hi>Vor</hi> scriptis <hi>ein gestrichenes, unlesbares Wort.</hi></note>, quae in <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>lucem ędidisti, adiunctis simul et Bibliis<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p8377">Hentius</persName> meint die von <persName ref="p1753">Leo Jud</persName> in Zusammenarbeit mit seinen <placeName ref="l587">Zürcher</placeName> Kollegen verfertigte lateinische Bibelübersetzung "Biblia sacrosancta" (<bibl>BZD</bibl> C 319f); vgl. <bibl source="b15">HBBW XII</bibl> <ref target="file11747">[Nr. 1702]</ref>, S. 272, 8-17 und oben <ref target="file11757">Nr. 1712</ref>.</note>, quae tempore quadragesimali istius <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>anni instantis ędita sunt, poposcerit<note xml:id="fni" type="footnote" n="i"><hi>Vor</hi> poposcerit <hi>gestrichenes</hi> quod.</note>, bona fide ad illud tempus <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>definitum, nempe ad<note xml:id="fnk" type="footnote" n="k">ad <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> festum Georgii<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">27. August.</note>, mittam certo ac fideli nuncio.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Cuperem quidem michi<pb type="edition" next="174"/> et mitti opera d. <persName ref="p8127">Pellicani</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p8377">Hentius</persName> meint die "Commentaria bibliorum", einen Kommentar <persName ref="p8127">Pellikans</persName> zur gesamten Bibel, dessen Erstausgabe in den Jahren 1533-1535, 1537 und 1539 erschienen war (<bibl>BZD</bibl> C 217, 266f, 282). 1543 lagen zudem die Teile 1-5 der zweiten Auflage (<bibl>BZD</bibl> C 256) vor.</note>; tamen, ne existimes <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>me multa optare, quae pręstare michi sint impossibilia, nunc itaque[?]<note xml:id="fnl" type="footnote" n="l">itaque[?] <hi>über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> his cariturum <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>me duxi; non tamen dubito, quin et eiusdem viri opera, si modo vivam, sim <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>habiturus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Caeterum me rogaverunt quidam studiosi, ut te orarem <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>pro catal<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ogo<note xml:id="fnm" type="footnote" n="m">catalogo <hi>über gestrichenem</hi> omnibus.</note> omnium pręcipuorum<note xml:id="fnn" type="footnote" n="n">praecipuorum <hi>über gestrichenem</hi> primarii.</note> tamen virorum<note xml:id="fno" type="footnote" n="o"><hi>Vor</hi> virorum <hi>ein gestrichenes, unlesbares Wort.</hi></note> operum, ut hoc <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>viso deinceps certis temporibus<note xml:id="fnp" type="footnote" n="p"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> temporis.</note> anni, quibus tum nundinę <placeName ref="l157">Francofordienses</placeName> celebrantur, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>libros, quibus his maxime opus sit, adferri curarent, nam vetitum <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>est <placeName ref="l558">Witembergensibus</placeName> bibliopolis aliquid operum vestrorum <placeName ref="l558">Vitembergam</placeName><note xml:id="fnq" type="footnote" n="q"><hi>Vor</hi> Vitembergam <hi>gestrichenes</hi> V.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>palam adferre<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Ein formelles Verbot lässt sich nicht nachweisen (für freundliche Auskunft danken wir Herrn PD Dr. Hans-Peter Hasse, Dresden).</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Itaque, ne studiosi quamplurimi sane tuisque ac<note xml:id="fnr" type="footnote" n="r"><hi>Vor</hi> ac <hi>gestrichenes</hi> et.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>aliorum orthodoxorum scriptorum lucubrationibus careant, rogo ac enixe <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>obsecro, catalogum descriptum michi mittere digneris; ubi ego vicissim<pb type="scan" next="232"/> <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>tuę amplitudini gratificari potero, sit quacunque in re, una cum reliquo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>studiosorum numero, meam operam polliceor sedulo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale ac me commen<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>datum tibi habeas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Datum <placeName ref="l558">Vitembergae</placeName>, tertio calendas augusti anno <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>virginei partus 1543.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/><persName ref="p8377">Martinus Heinczius</persName> tibi tuisque <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>deditissimus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Salutato omnes, inprimis d. <persName ref="p8171">Bibliandrum</persName> meque excusato, cur nihil literarum ad eum dederim, item d. <persName ref="p4851">Christopho[rum] <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Frosch[ouerum]</persName>, item d. <persName ref="p8011">Gvalderum</persName>, magistrum <persName ref="p8459">Ottonem Werthmiller</persName> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse darunter:]</note>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Docto et pio viro d. magistro <persName ref="p495">Heinrico Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiasti apud <placeName ref="l587">Tygurin<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>os</placeName>, domino ac amico semper honorando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
